@startuml
title Expense lifecycle — proposed states and valid transitions
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Pending : submit / validation succeeds
Draft --> Draft : validation failure / correct input
Pending --> Pending : authorized approval / more required
Pending --> Approved : authorized approval / policy satisfied
Pending --> Rejected : authorized rejection
Pending --> Withdrawn : submitter withdraws [if policy allows]
Approved --> Superseded : correction via new revision [policy decision]
Rejected --> Draft : resubmit [policy decision]
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]
Superseded --> [*]
note right of Pending
No balance effect.
end note
note right of Approved
Included in canonical balance calculation.
end note
@enduml
